{'symbol': 'LIN', 'date': '2022-02-07 06:30:00', 'title': 'LINDE EXPANDS AGREEMENT WITH CELANESE TO PROVIDE DECARBONIZATION SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'GULDFORD, UK / ACCESSWIRE / FEBRUARY 7, 2022 / LINDE (NYSE:LIN; FWB:LIN) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS EXPANDED ITS EXISTING AGREEMENT WITH CELANESE CORPORATION, A GLOBAL CHEMICAL AND SPECIALTY MATERIALS COMPANY, AND WILL BEGIN SUPPLYING CARBON DIOXIDE AND HYDROGEN TO THE CELANESE MANUFACTURING FACILITY IN CLEAR LAKE, TEXAS. LINDE CURRENTLY SUPPLIES OXYGEN, NITROGEN AND CARBON MONOXIDE TO THE CLEAR LAKE FACILITY.'}